'' 'type( e )' WITH NO TYPE NAMED over a scalar destination -- 'function =', 'return', 'dim', '=' --
'' is e converted (fbc's functions/paraminit-int.bi); tiko typed it a one-element tuple and
'' declined. The UDT lines are the control. Expected output is fbc-modern's.
